additional_info.body:
During charging, we receive meter values ​​in our backend. However, the transmitted meter value does not contain any information about the kWh consumed. We absolutely need this value for billing and to stop the transaction in a timely manner when the reserved amount is reached. Is it possible to include this value in the meter value? It was included in the Hectronic x Sicharge D backend configuration. An example meter value is shown below:
{
"connectorId": 1,
"transactionId": 1650538850,
"meterValue": [
{
"timestamp": "2026-03-08T14:03:46.234Z",
"sampledValue": [
{
"value": "99",
"location": "EV",
"unit": "Percent",
"measurand": "SoC",
"context": "Sample.Periodic"
},
{
"value": "120000",
"location": "Outlet",
"unit": "W",
"measurand": "Power.Offered",
"context": "Sample.Periodic"
},
{
"value": "109",
"location": "Outlet",
"unit": "A",
"measurand": "Current.Offered",
"context": "Sample.Periodic"
}
]
}
]
}
